    "detailed_description": "The Shy GigaChad Denisyich sets out to an unknown STREET to not only defeat the mysterious enemy who disrupted the protein supply but also to find true friends. Smash enemies with your huge fists, collect strange items with unclear effects, and help suspicious characters out of the kindness of your heart because only you can save your beloved gym!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ULTIMATE GIGACHADNESS</h2> Powerful muscles and a loyal bloodthirsty companion \u2014 what more could you ask for in the perfect starter pack for a child of the gym? Enhance your physical abilities to become the most powerful GigaChad on the city streets. No guns or swords \u2014 just your enormous fists and willpower!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/bf7acd54237b207a1468f7c442bee446.poster.avif?t=1754337660\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/bf7acd54237b207a1468f7c442bee446.webm?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/bf7acd54237b207a1468f7c442bee446.mp4?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNPREDICTABLE ARTIFACTS</h2> Explore the world and find over dozens items with absolutely unpredictable effects. Each discovery can either help or harm, and you'll have to try them on your own skin to find out!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/2d57f9febe3750541d1d679a327bf968.poster.avif?t=1754337660\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/2d57f9febe3750541d1d679a327bf968.webm?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/2d57f9febe3750541d1d679a327bf968.mp4?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WILD STORY QUESTS</h2> Dive into thrilling missions: meet the grind cult, save a micro-dude from bullying, smash a secret underground laboratory, and much more. Each adventure is a step toward saving the gym and uncovering the city's mysteries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/7165d2b46f23462d69f30a217d5dd005.poster.avif?t=1754337660\" width=518 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/7165d2b46f23462d69f30a217d5dd005.webm?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/7165d2b46f23462d69f30a217d5dd005.mp4?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNEXPLORED WORLD</h2> Fight social anxiety and explore new locations. Don't get lost in the city park, stir up trouble in the homeless king's quarter, or just run to the store for milk! Every new area will surprise you with its residents and quests, but be careful \u2014 not everyone will want to be friends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/1fe5779abea046338328e5c238e63d28.poster.avif?t=1754337660\" width=622 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/1fe5779abea046338328e5c238e63d28.webm?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/1fe5779abea046338328e5c238e63d28.mp4?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLIMITED FUN</h2> Memes, strange items, and absurd inhabitants of this world won't let you get bored for a second, especially with their attempts to kill you! Enjoy the humor and chaos while you fight for the well-being of your protein paradise!",
