eo/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/2d57f9febe3750541d1d679a327bf968.mp4?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WILD STORY QUESTS</h2> Dive into thrilling missions: meet the grind cult, save a micro-dude from bullying, smash a secret underground laboratory, and much more. Each adventure is a step toward saving the gym and uncovering the city's mysteries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/7165d2b46f23462d69f30a217d5dd005.poster.avif?t=1754337660\" width=518 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/7165d2b46f23462d69f30a217d5dd005.webm?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/7165d2b46f23462d69f30a217d5dd005.mp4?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNEXPLORED WORLD</h2> Fight social anxiety and explore new locations. Don't get lost in the city park, stir up trouble in the homeless king's quarter, or just run to the store for milk! Every new area will surprise you with its residents and quests, but be careful \u2014 not everyone will want to be friends!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/1fe5779abea046338328e5c238e63d28.poster.avif?t=1754337660\" width=622 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/1fe5779abea046338328e5c238e63d28.webm?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032360/extras/1fe5779abea046338328e5c238e63d28.mp4?t=1754337660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLIMITED FUN</h2> Memes, strange items, and absurd inhabitants of this world won't let you get bored for a second, especially with their attempts to kill you! Enjoy the humor and chaos while you fight for the well-being of your protein paradise!",
